{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Play the Demo now for free.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover a neon-lit dystopia full of exciting challenges in Nion Forge - the action-packed <strong>cyberpunk roguelite</strong>! Here you have the opportunity to <strong>build your own spaceship</strong> and fight above the dystopian streets as you face off against hordes of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be surprised by unique upgrades and weapons that make every playthrough a new experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Nion Forge, you combine auto-firing weapons and special cockpit abilities and weapons to actively and passively take on masses of enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only by selecting the best ship parts and perfecting your own play style can you master all 9 districts and defeat their bosses. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>Will you be the first fighter to escape the city arena and attain your freedom?</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/6a0a6f137f2409d82036816b8ef2e380.avif?t=1764472765\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Agile or powerful? What weapons, what drive?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your ship to suit your style and be better prepared next time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/f9aa4f315b8878234554c5065c4438d8.poster.avif?t=1764472765\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/f9aa4f315b8878234554c5065c4438d8.webm?t=1764472765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst