imited time to escape the city!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/5c488fc8d4a1331fa56cf2b64b79b3c4.avif?t=1764472765\" width=600 height=94 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Defeated enemies drop valuable materials, which you can trade between escape attempts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >for over 100 different ship modules.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/eeb89a57784bddccba7f87221a1e97cc.poster.avif?t=1764472765\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/eeb89a57784bddccba7f87221a1e97cc.webm?t=1764472765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/eeb89a57784bddccba7f87221a1e97cc.mp4?t=1764472765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Modules often provide functionality in themselves, but also add cards to the next run's upgrade pool.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/72dc7a9be3c03173f90b47791f81a1db.poster.avif?t=1764472765\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/72dc7a9be3c03173f90b47791f81a1db.webm?t=1764472765\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2954090/extras/72dc7a9be3c03173f90b47791f81a1db.mp4?t=1764472765\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","back